Error [E0712]: this `#Abilities` region uses the effect `FS`, which it has no ability for
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_nonce_region_caps_precedence.jet:6:15
    |
  6 |     #Abilities(Net) {
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: `#Abilities(…)` allows only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: add `FS` to the `#Abilities(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
